<div style="max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: linear-gradient(to bottom right, #fff5f5, #ffffff); padding: 35px; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color: #222;">

  <h2 style="color: #b91c1c; font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 16px;">🚨 Suspicious Login Attempt Detected</h2>

  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6;">
    Hello <strong>{{userName}}</strong>,
  </p>

  <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; color: #444;">
    We detected a failed login attempt from an unfamiliar device or location. Here are the details:
  </p>

  <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #555; margin: 20px 0;">
    <li><strong>🕒 Time:</strong> {{attemptTime}}</li>
    <li><strong>🌐 IP Address:</strong> {{ipAddress}}</li>
    <li><strong>📍 Location:</strong> {{location}}</li>
    <li><strong>💻 Device:</strong> {{device}}</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333;">
    If this was <strong>you</strong>, you can safely ignore this message. Otherwise, we strongly recommend the following actions:
  </p>

  <ul style="font-size: 15px; color: #444; margin: 15px 0 30px;">
    <li>🔒 Change your password immediately</li>
    <li>✅ Enable two-factor authentication (2FA)</li>
    <li>📊 Review your recent account activity</li>
  </ul>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <a href="{{link}}" target="_blank" style="background-color: #dc2626; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;">
      Secure My Account
    </a>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #666;">
    Need assistance? <a href="mailto:support@yourcompany.com" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: none;">Contact support</a>.
  </p>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 14px; color: #555;">
    Thanks, <br />
    <strong>{{companyName}} Security Team</strong>
  </p>
</div>
